# Optional. Leave unset for normal development.
#
# The app resolves its API base URL in this order:
#   1. EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL below — an explicit override always wins
#   2. Metro's host — dev builds auto-follow the machine serving the bundle,
#      so a changed LAN IP needs no rebuild and no edit here
#   3. extra.productionApiUrl in app.json — release builds, which have no Metro
#   4. loopback — last resort, correct only in the iOS simulator
#
# Set this only to aim a build at something other than the machine running
# Metro — a staging API, a colleague's box, a tunnel.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://staging.example.com
